ytoskeletal rearrangements required for phagocytosis of apoptotic cells and cell motility (PubMed:11595183)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}